 ```
 
+##### limit
+
+The maximum number of ranges to take from one header. When the header has more
+ranges than `limit` (counted after `combine`, if enabled), a single range from
+the lowest start to the highest end is returned instead. Defaults to no limit.
+
+<!-- eslint-disable no-undef -->
+
+```js
+parseRange(100, 'bytes=50-55,0-10,70-75', { limit: 2 })
+// => [{ start: 0, end: 75 }]
+```
+
